@startuml
title SSD - USLP02: Station Storage Manager Cargo Handling (compatível)

actor "Station Storage Manager" as Manager
boundary "Cargo Handling System" as System

' 1. Acesso ao sistema
Manager -> System: Access Cargo Handling
activate System
System --> Manager: Show available cargos and wagons
deactivate System

' 2. Loop: Escolher carga válida
loop Until a valid cargo is selected
    Manager -> System: Select cargo X
    activate System
    alt Cargo available
        System --> Manager: Confirm "Cargo X selected"
    else Cargo not available
        System --> Manager: Error "Cargo X not available"
        System --> Manager: Show available cargos again
    end
    deactivate System
end

' 3. Loop: Escolher vagão válido
loop Until a valid wagon is selected
    Manager -> System: Select wagon Y
    activate System
    alt Wagon available and not full
        System --> Manager: Confirm "Cargo X loaded into wagon Y"
    else Wagon full or unavailable
        System --> Manager: Error "Wagon not available or full"
        System --> Manager: Show available wagons again
    end
    deactivate System
end

' 4. Sair do sistema
Manager -> System: Exit
activate System
System --> Manager: Close interface
deactivate System

@enduml
